+          <dd pn="section-5.6-2.10">This action is taken when an authenticated message is received
+from the active router.  If the virtual IP address for this
+group was not manually configured, the virtual IP address <bcp14>MAY</bcp14>
+be learned from the message.  The router <bcp14>MAY</bcp14> learn Hellotime
+and Holdtime values from the message.</dd>
